    },
    "いちばんやさしい判定です。線を分けて書いても、つなげて書いても、形が合えば合格にします。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The gentlest setting. If the shape matches, it passes, whether the strokes are written separately or joined."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いちばん厳しい判定です。形を細かく見て、画数の違いも合格にしません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The strictest setting. It checks the shape closely, and a different number of strokes does not pass."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつも使う子": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Main child"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつも使う子にする": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make main child"
