        }
      }
    },
    "お子さまが鍵のかかった文字を見て、おとなにおねがいしました。購入するかどうかは、保護者の方が決めてください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your child saw a locked letter and asked a grown-up. Whether to buy is up to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お子さまの指や顔が iPad に登録されていると、お子さまでも通れます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your child's fingerprint or face is registered on this iPad, your child may also get through."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お子さんが間違って開かないように、かけ算の確認があります。学習記録や判定の変更は、ここから行います。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A multiplication question keeps children from opening it by accident. You can see learning records and change judging here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
