    "アプリが落ちたときだけ、落ちた場所・アプリの版・iPadOS の版・iPad の種類を、品質を直すために送ります。名前・記録・子どもが書いた線・端末の ID は送りません。くわしくはプライバシーポリシーをごらんください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only when the app crashes, it sends where it crashed, the app version, the iPadOS version and the iPad model, so we can fix the problem. It never sends names, records, the lines your child wrote, or device IDs. See the privacy policy for details."
          }
        }
